'''The Dares''', a rock/pop band first formed by twin brothers in 2003, recorded the ''[[Free Realms]]'' official<ref>http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/the-dares-rock-free-realmstm-with-its-your-world-theme-song-61990437.html</ref> theme song, “It’s Your World” written and composed by [[wikipedia:Robbie Nevil|Robbie Nevil]] and [[wikipedia:Matthew Gerrard|Matthew Gerrard]] exclusively for [[wikipedia:Sony Online Entertainment|SOE]].

The Dares also had the official site, seen [http://TheDares.com here].

==The Free Realms Theme Song==
Their song, “It’s Your World”, had been written and produced for SOE as the Official Free Realms theme song, it has become iconic to Free Realms having been featured in Free Realms television spot commercials<ref>http://youtu.be/WSM2re7w-Z0</ref> and featured in game performed by [[Bruce]], a talented rockstar, in the past.

{{Quote|"To record the theme song for a video game with as much buzz as Free Realms is epic! Not only does this song fit in with our sound, but it also gets across the feeling that in Free Realms you can do what you want, when you want."|Ben Peterson, lead singer of The Dares<ref>http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/the-dares-rock-free-realmstm-with-its-your-world-theme-song-61990437.html</ref>}}

===It's Your World Music Video===
A music video for their song, “It’s Your World”, had been unveiled as the Official Free Realms theme song video in April 2009 in celebration of Free Realms' first birthday.<ref>http://massively.joystiq.com/2010/04/21/free-realms-unveils-its-your-world-video/</ref>

In November 2009<ref>http://www.soepress.com/content/press/press-releases/2009/11/the_dares_unveiloff.html</ref> The Dares released the official music video for “It’s Your World” which, at the time, was featured exclusively<ref>http://www.freerealms.com/article/detail.action?articleId=1269</ref> on AOL.com.
[[File:The Dares – It's Your World|thumb|center|335 px|It's Your World official music video]]

==E3 2009==
[[File:Thedaresposter.jpg|thumb|Promotional poster for the E3 performance]]
On June 2, 2009, at the world known [[wikipedia:Electronic Entertainment Expo|E3]] gaming exhibition, The Dares held a performance for a live concert audience at the SOE booth and simultaneously in Free Realms,<ref>http://www.soepress.com/content/press/press-releases/2009/06/rock_band_the_dares.html</ref> which earned them a plaque from the [[wikipedia:Guinness World Records|Guinness World Records]] for being the first time it had been done.<ref>http://massively.joystiq.com/2009/06/03/e3-2009-free-realms-and-the-dares-set-world-record-concert-even/</ref>

Players who logged on Free Realms, server 1, at 4pm Pacific had the opportunity to see The Dares E3 Performance live at [[Snowhill]]'s stage.<ref>http://www.freerealms.com/article/detail.action?articleId=106#</ref>

[[File:The Dares Perform at E3 and in Free Realms|thumb|center|335 px|The Dares live E3 Performance]]

